    summary: '中国文学史上留存诗作最多的诗人，一生9000余首诗，以收复中原的爱国情怀贯穿始终。',
    summaryEn: 'The most prolific poet in Chinese literary history with over 9,000 surviving poems, his lifelong theme was the patriotic dream of recovering the lost north.',
